<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface font-bold tracking-tight">Business Admin Login</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Sign in to your company attendance dashboard and manage your workforce.</p>
